  "legalMedicalDisclaimer": "Megrim is a personal diary and is not a medical device. It does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any condition. \"Suspected factors\" are statistical associations in your own log — association is not causation. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional about your migraines and before making any treatment decisions.",
  "@legalMedicalDisclaimer": {
    "description": "[legal] [medical] The medical disclaimer, accepted during onboarding and shown in About and the PDF report. Needs a second reviewer. Keep 'Megrim' untranslated; 'Suspected factors' is the name of an Analytics card."
  },
  "legalPrivacySummary": "All data stays on your device. We operate no servers and collect nothing — no accounts, no analytics, no identifiers, no crash reporting. Weather enrichment is off unless you turn it on; then the app's only automatic network traffic is to Open-Meteo.com, to fetch weather for the approximate (~1 km rounded) location and date of entries you create. Backups use your phone's own backup (Google on Android, iCloud or your computer on iPhone), which you control in its settings; export files go wherever you choose to save them.",
  "@legalPrivacySummary": {
    "description": "[legal] Privacy summary in About. Must stay as precise as the English: what is sent, to whom, and when. Keep 'Open-Meteo.com' as is."
  },
  "legalWeatherAttribution": "Weather data by Open-Meteo.com",
  "@legalWeatherAttribution": {
    "description": "[legal] Attribution required by Open-Meteo's CC-BY 4.0 licence. Keep 'Open-Meteo.com' as is."
  },
  "legalAppTitle": "Megrim: Migraine Log",
  "@legalAppTitle": {
    "description": "Store-style title shown in About. Keep 'Megrim' untranslated."
  },
  "legalAppSubtitle": "Offline Migraine Log",
  "@legalAppSubtitle": {
    "description": "Store-style subtitle shown in About and on the Log screen."
  },
  "legalShortDescription": "Private, offline migraine log with automatic on-device pattern insights.",
  "@legalShortDescription": {
    "description": "One-line description shown in About."
  },
  "legalFullDescription": "Megrim is an open-source, offline-first migraine diary that helps you find your personal triggers. The app automatically adds time-of-day, season, daylight and moon context to your entries (and, if you opt in, local weather and barometric pressure), calculating correlations entirely on your phone. With no accounts, no cloud servers, and zero tracking, your health data stays completely private and under your control.",
  "@legalFullDescription": {
    "description": "Full description shown in About. Keep 'Megrim' untranslated."
  },
  "legalCaveatOddsRatioExplained": "OR = odds ratio: how much more likely a migraine is on days with that factor. OR 2.0 ≈ twice the odds vs. other days; OR 1.0 means no effect.",
  "@legalCaveatOddsRatioExplained": {
